Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:06.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio. This is a story from before you were born...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:10.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A story up to when you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:16.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your Mommy and Daddy first spoke to each other when we were seniors in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:18.92,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,That's when you first met?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:22.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. We didn't even know each other's name until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:32.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sweet bean bread! {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.81,0:00:36.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Do you like this school? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:39.61,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I really, really love it. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:43.90,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But nothing can stay unchanged. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:54.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Fun things... Happy things... {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:00:58.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,They can't all possibly stay unchanged. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:01.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Even so, can you keep on loving this place? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:05.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just find them. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:21.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just find new fun and happy things. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.82,0:01:25.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's get going. {S1 ep1}
