Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:05.13,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Forever and ever, I shall hold it dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:14.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's how we got to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:19.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mommy was a year older than everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:27.27,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um, how can I help you? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:30.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wanted to ask why you're eating lunch out here alone. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:34.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Do you like this school? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.45,0:03:36.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Not particularly. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:39.83,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I really, really love it. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:45.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I used to have friends and teachers I got along with, but now... {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:46.79,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Did something happen? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:52.01,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Last year, I was away from school for a long period of time. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.01,0:03:53.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So I'm... {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:54.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're repeating. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.89,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm repeating. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:07.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,All the people I knew graduated,\Nand only people I don't know fill the school. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:10.32,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: Urashima Tarou is a story in which the protagonist jumps forward in time and finds no one he knew alive. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:10.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I feel like Urashima Tarou. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:17.70,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Recap
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:17.70,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}Under the Green Tree
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:21.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Daddy was an outcast at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:40.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But after meeting Mommy,\Nthings started to change little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:45.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mommy was trying to get involved in theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.73,0:04:50.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But to do that, she first had to reestablish the Theater Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:52.44,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,You helped her do that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:57.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. Mommy was so serious about it, I couldn't ignore her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:06.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even then, Mommy loved the Big Dango Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:09.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You love it, too, don't you, Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.33,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,0)\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs99\an5\c&H343434&\pos(970.5,207)}Join the Theater Club
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.33,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,0)\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs72\an5\c&H343434&\pos(1080,450)}Open House       15th May
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.33,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,0)\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs63\an5\c&H252726&\pos(1263,714)}President         Furukawa Nagisa
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:10.59,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:15.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mommy was practicing alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:18.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She had a play she wanted to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.35,0:05:24.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...would you like me to take you? {S1 ep2}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:30.40,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,To the place in this city where wishes come true. {S1 ep2}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:34.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then started the gathering of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:38.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,First to join us was Fujibayashi Kyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:42.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You know her. She's your teacher at kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.75,0:05:46.87,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You can't. {S1 ep17}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:51.08,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm... how do I put it... not dating you or anything. {S1 ep17}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.04,0:05:53.59,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Besides, Ryou would... {S1 ep17}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:55.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop! Stop! {S1 ep17}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:56.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Listen to me! {S1 ep17}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:06:02.10,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Of course, you're a boy,\Nso I understand you have an interest in it... {S1 ep17}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:05.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then her younger sister, Fujibayashi Ryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:08.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She was Daddy's class representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:11.94,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,O-Okay. I will listen to you seriously. {S1 ep4}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.94,0:06:14.69,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It's starting to look more and more like a Theater Club. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.69,0:06:18.65,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,All girls like fortune-telling at the genetic level. {S1 ep18}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:22.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The smartest girl in school joined us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:24.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ichinose Kotomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:27.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She turned out to be a childhood friend of Daddy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.71,0:06:30.08,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,So nice. {S1 ep10}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:32.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There were many others, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:35.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Like Sakagami Tomoyo from the junior class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:39.84,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,The path we are taking is still continuing. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:41.09,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Let us both keep working hard. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:42.47,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,It's a promise. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:46.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sagara Misae-san, the dorm parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:53.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Also, Miyazawa Yukine, who was always in the Reference Room to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.31,0:06:58.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Miyazawa taught me the legend that's told in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.99,0:07:02.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"An orb of light appears to those who are happy."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:06.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She says that getting hold of those will grant wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:11.42,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,How about Youhei Oji-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:13.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh right, forgot about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:17.00,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This is the game in the name of love guys play. {S2 ep2}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:21.26,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,In other words, it's a boy love game. {S2 ep2}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:28.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I once worked with Mei-chan, his younger sister, to get him back on the soccer club, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:35.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If he hadn't been there, I probably would have dropped out of school before I met Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.07,0:07:47.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We all went to different places,\Nbut we still get together from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:52.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,They all came to our place last New Year's,\Nso you remember them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:07:59.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Many things happened before\Nthe Theater Club was reestablished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:04.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,For example, Yoshino Yusuke-san and Kouko-san's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:09.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kouko-san had a sister who was in hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.47,0:08:12.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That'd be your friend, Fuko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.44,0:08:20.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Other than members, we had to find a teacher who would watch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:24.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There was a fight over Koumura-sensei with the Choir,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:28.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,and we even challenged\Nthe basketball team to convince the Choir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:35.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,In the end, Kyou, Sunohara,\Nand everyone else joined the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:41.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The Theater Club finally started to move thanks to the work of many people, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:46.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...after that, trouble emerged for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:49.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Pops, if you're going to sleep, you should lie down. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:51.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:55.27,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Oh, hi. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:59.27,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I guess I caused Tomoya-kun some trouble again. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:05.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Back then, Daddy wasn't getting along with Daddy's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:10.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I left home and decided to live at Mommy's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.87,0:09:15.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Father. {S1 ep19}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:23.00,Default,San,0,0,0,,So my... my bread is... {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,H-Hey. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:27.76,Default,San,0,0,0,,It was natural there would be leftovers?! {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.59,0:09:29.22,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Like mother, like daughter. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:31.93,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,I hope the father is sane. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.93,0:09:32.81,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.35,0:09:34.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:37.89,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You said what you're not supposed to say. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.81,0:09:41.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You don't need to hear about Sanae-san and Akki, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:46.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There was a time when we all played baseball at Akki's request.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.45,0:09:53.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Both Sanae-san and Akki welcomed me into their home kindly from the first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.45,0:10:01.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wasn't too sure what a family was like,\Nso I was lost in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:06.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But Sanae-san and Akki were both looking after me from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:12.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mommy was physically weak,\Nso sometimes she'd be in bed, sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:18.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san and Akki took great care of Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:22.81,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,The truth is always harsh. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:28.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The School Festival was coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:33.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We started to work hard for our play.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:41.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But something came up at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:44.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,These pictures... {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:48.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I found old albums and diaries. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.51,0:10:51.72,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san, I never knew about this. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:54.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I never knew Dad used to act. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.56,0:11:01.73,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,And yet... they both gave up their dreams for me... {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.41,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This isn't good! Let's drop the curtain. {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:23.04,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Make your dream come true, Nagisa!!! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.13,0:11:26.13,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What? {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.13,0:11:26.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Old man? {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.59,0:11:28.34,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nagisa! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.01,0:11:31.09,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot or what?! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:33.89,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,A child's dream is their parents' dream! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:35.60,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,So you grant it for us! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.60,0:11:39.10,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We've been dreaming of the day you would make your dream come true! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:42.23,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We didn't give up our dreams! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.23,0:11:44.85,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We changed our dreams to your dream! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:47.40,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,That's what parents are! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:50.15,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,That's what family is!!! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.78,0:11:53.15,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,So... ever since that day... {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:55.45,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Every day, while baking bread... {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:59.79,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,...we've been living, waiting for this day! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:03.50,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,If you fail here, we'll be depressed! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:04.54,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:08.17,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You've got a huge responsibility on your back, you hear me?! {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:27.61,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Shall I... {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:30.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Shall I take you? {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:36.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,To the place in this city where wishes come true? {ep1}{S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.37,0:12:39.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Take us there, Nagisa. {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:41.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Take us away. {S1 ep22}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:48.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The play ended as a great success.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.13,0:12:50.67,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,What was the story about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:54.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A story of a girl who lived in a world that had ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.47,0:12:58.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We didn't know the title or the author of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:00.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The ending of the story was a mystery, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:06.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mommy said it might be something she heard from someone when she was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.77,0:13:12.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But strangely, it felt like I knew the story, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:25.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then Mommy and Daddy promised to keep walking together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:37.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Right before graduation, a major problem arose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.47,0:13:41.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mommy became ill and couldn't graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:44.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was really shocked, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:56.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I should have repeated, too, after all. {S2 ep9}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.95,0:13:59.99,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun. {S2 ep9}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:06.08,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You can't stop like that. {S2 ep9}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:09.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If you can move on, then you should. {S2 ep9}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:11.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please move on. {S2 ep9}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:40.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,After graduation, I helped\NSanae-san and Akki for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:49.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I knew I couldn't do that forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:55.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So I asked Yoshino-san and got work at an electrical company.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.55,0:15:00.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Obviously, I only made mistakes in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:03.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I might have given up if it had been the me from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:13.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I managed to keep with it thanks to\NMommy's support and coworkers helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:19.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mommy did her best to keep going to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:21.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:29.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,At that time, there was a chance for\NDaddy to transfer to a bigger company.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:33.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But due to various issues, it fell through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.59,0:15:44.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Again, Mommy was the person who supported me when I was about to give up on everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:48.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That was when I proposed to Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:56.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I couldn't get married right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.11,0:16:01.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mommy got ill again and couldn't go to her graduation after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:10.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But for Mommy's sake, everyone gathered and held a graduation for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:15.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Daddy and Mommy got married right after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:24.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We became husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:27.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then in Mommy's tummy, a baby came.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:30.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That was you, Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:31.89,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:37.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But Mommy wasn't strong physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:41.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It was a big hassle until you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:50.83,Default,San,0,0,0,,I was told by the doctor that there will be some danger during the delivery. {S2 ep15}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:54.16,Default,San,0,0,0,,I have not told this to Nagisa yet. {S2 ep15}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:56.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,Only I've been told. {S2 ep15}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:17:03.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When I was getting crushed from the anxiety,\NAkki told me an old story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:08.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The trees and bushes enveloped the sick Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:13.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Before he noticed it, Mommy was returned to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:16.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A story like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:21.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio? Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:24.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Did she fall asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I have a strange memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.87,0:17:34.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I haven't told Ushio yet, but she was born once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:41.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,In that memory, Nagisa died when Ushio was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:56.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I left Ushio in the care of the Furukawas and lived alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:04.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then, during the summer Ushio was five.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:13.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We went on a trip just like Sanae-san had planned, and at the final destination...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.88,0:18:25.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Grandmother told me many stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:29.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just as I told many stories right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.64,0:18:34.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It was a story from before I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.65,0:18:43.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Right now, Pops is back at his mother's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.57,0:18:48.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm planning to go see him in the near future with Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.45,0:18:56.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So we started living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:19:00.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio's teacher at the kindergarten was Kyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:07.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio became friends with Fuko, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:11.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Everything was going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.64,0:19:13.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Until...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.93,0:19:17.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ushio? {S2 ep20}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:21.44,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I couldn't pee alone. {S2 ep20}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.73,0:19:28.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ushio?! {S2 ep20}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:34.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It felt like I was having a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.66,0:19:38.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Of course, Ushio beside me is doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:41.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's never caught any major illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:49.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But Ushio in that world never recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.23,0:20:08.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,At that moment, something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.33,0:20:21.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When I came to, Nagisa was right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:25.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was back to five years ago, the day Ushio was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.67,0:20:28.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's such a strange thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.85,0:20:46.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I think it's something that really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:05.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa and I met in this city,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.21,0:21:08.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,and Ushio was born in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:11.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I met many people in this city,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.96,0:21:14.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,and I lived through many things in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:21.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'll continue to live, being supported by many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.52,0:21:23.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Right in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.07,0:21:37.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:38.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Fuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:39.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You'll catch colds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:41.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's about time you both wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.63,0:21:57.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Shio-chan! Daddy! Fu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.51,0:22:00.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Let's head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.93,0:22:01.97,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.97,0:22:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
