Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:27.02,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.02,0:23:34.53,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.02,0:23:34.53,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.53,0:23:39.78,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
